{
 "name": "AgentKit · 05 — Support Bot",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "d40c8d63-dedc-4044-a710-6bb5dcbd3ead",
   "name": "📌 SETUP GUIDE",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    180,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "color": 4,
    "content": "## 🎧 AgentKit · 05 — Support Bot\n**Telegram support bot jo SIRF tumhare FAQ se jawab de — hallucination nahi.**\n\n**Setup (10 min):**\n1. **Knowledge base** — Google Sheet, tab `faq`, columns: `question | answer`. Apne 10-20 common sawal-jawab likho.\n2. **Telegram + AI + Sheets** — credentials + IDs (pehle wali tarah).\n3. **Active** karo → bot se product sawal pucho.\n\n**Flow:** Trigger → FAQ sheet parho → AI (strict: sirf context se jawab, warna fallback) → reply → Q&A log.\n**Pro tip:** `fallback_text` mein apna WhatsApp number do — unknown sawal pe customer tum tak aaye.\n**Sachaai:** chhoti KB = behtar jawab. 50+ rows pe AI confuse ho sakta hai — tab vector DB ka socho (README).\n",
    "height": 740,
    "width": 620
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c4851852-47fd-495e-9c3f-80c5dc47dbb6",
   "name": "📩 Telegram Trigger",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    240,
